<title>UK: Norway's Troll to load 7.6 mln bbls in March.</title>
<headline>Norway's Troll to load 7.6 mln bbls in March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 7.6 million barrels of crude in March, up from 6.7 million in February, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the March programme comprised 14 cargoes, one more than in February.  </p>
<p>The March programme consists of six cargoes of 600,000 barrels, five of 400,000 barrels and one each of 800,000, 700,000 and 500,000 barrels, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
